{"text":"kuruntokai","n":321,"lines":["மலைச்செஞ் சாந்தின் ஆர மார்பினன்","சுனைப்பூங் குவளைச் சுரும்பார் கண்ணியன்","நடுநாள் வந்து நம்மனைப் பெயரும்","மடவர லரிவைநின் மார்பமர் இன்றுணை","மன்ற மரையா இரிய ஏறட்டுச்","செங்கண் இரும்புலி குழுமும் அதனால்","மறைத்தற் காலையோ அன்றே","திறப்பல் வாழிவேண் டன்னைநம் கதவே"],"tr":["malaicceñ cāntiṉ āra mārpiṉaṉ","cuṉaippūṅ kuvaḷaic curumpār kaṇṇiyaṉ","naṭunāḷ vantu nammaṉaip peyarum","maṭavara larivainiṉ mārpamar iṉṟuṇai","maṉṟa maraiyā iriya ēṟaṭṭuc","ceṅkaṇ irumpuli kuḻumum ataṉāl","maṟaittaṟ kālaiyō aṉṟē","tiṟappal vāḻivēṇ ṭaṉṉainam katavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"8 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"7×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 27, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 15, āciriyattaḷai 14, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மலைச்செஞ்","tr":"malaicceñ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலைச்","tr":"malaic"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"செஞ்","tr":"ceñ"}]},{"text":"சாந்தின்","tr":"cāntiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சாந்","tr":"cān"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தின்","tr":"tiṉ"}]},{"text":"ஆர","tr":"āra","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ர","tr":"ra"}]},{"text":"மார்பினன்","tr":"mārpiṉaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மார்","tr":"mār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பினன்","tr":"piṉaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"சுனைப்பூங்","tr":"cuṉaippūṅ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுனைப்","tr":"cuṉaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூங்","tr":"pūṅ"}]},{"text":"குவளைச்","tr":"kuvaḷaic","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவ","tr":"kuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளைச்","tr":"ḷaic"}]},{"text":"சுரும்பார்","tr":"curumpār","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai",